### Minecraft Modding ###
/run/*
# Of run/rwat_packs/ only these packs are in the repository: the example pack
# (CC0, tools/gen_example_pack.py) for good, the generated MVP pack for now (see
# below). When MVP is taken out of the repository (roadmap R12) its line goes and
# the example pack stays: !/run/rwat_packs/RwatExamplePack/. Other packs dropped
# into run/rwat_packs/ for testing stay local.
!/run/rwat_packs/
/run/rwat_packs/*
!/run/rwat_packs/RwatExamplePack/
!/run/rwat_packs/MatoiVanillaPack/
!**/src/**/run/
**/src/generated/**/.cache/
repo/
!**/src/**/repo/

### Python ###
__pycache__/
*.pyc

### Claude Code ###
.claude/settings.local.json

### RWAT local files ###
# Source IR packs for tools/ir2rwat.py (MVP-IR-*.zip) and the pack generated from them
# (run/rwat_packs/MatoiVanillaPack/): third-party, CC BY-NC-ND 4.0. In the repository
# FOR NOW, so cloud agents can measure and regenerate the stock
# (docs/agents/walkable-stock.md); to be taken out again (R12) — then ignore
# /MVP-IR-*.zip here and drop the MatoiVanillaPack line above.
# Reference models/textures unpacked from those packs
/DevAssets/
# Third-party mod jars for local testing
/disabled-mods/
# Decompiled Minecraft classes kept for reference
/net/
# Debug screenshots and profiler dumps
/*.png
*.sparkprofile

